      "message": "[error] Line 1508: 🔴 `announced_` is marked before the asynchronous load/clone can run. If the user removes an as-yet-unfetched document in the interval, `removeDocumentReplica()` finds no `SyncedConversation` and records no removal tombstone; this task then creates the conversation and auto-clones it anyway. The same early mark also permanently suppresses retry if the parent is temporarily inactive. Record the local-removal state independently of an existing repository and clear/retry the announcement when loading is refused.",
